  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new IT system under the 2016-2020 ICT Strategy for the judiciary ready for use by 2020
A new IT system under the 2021-2023 ICT Programme for the judiciary ready for use by 2023</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistical information on the performance of the judicial system is not systematically analysed, nor used for management and policy-making purposes</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of work with selected companies in the process of finalisation of development of software for Court sub-system. Realization/Testing phase of sub-system for Courts and Electronic exchange of data between Courts and other judicial institutions finalised. Users of the sub-system trained to use the new Judicial Information System</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Realization/Testing phase of sub-system for Courts and Electronic exchange of data between Courts and other judicial institutions is delayed and finalization instead of this year is expected next year. Implementation severely delayed due to complexity of the software being developed, inability of vendor to finalise the work and partnership issues with vendor.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of work with selected companies in the process of finalisation of development of software for Court sub-system and the Institute for Enforcement of Criminal Sanctions in cooperation with the ICT teams from the Ministry of Justice and Judicial Council. Both sub-systems in production phase and users being trained to use systems in their daily work.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICT sub-system of Institute for Enforcement of Criminal Sanctions is finalized and put in production. All staff of the Institute for the Enforcement of Criminal Sanctions (114) trained to use the new information system. 
Realization phase of sub-system for Courts and Electronic exchange of data between Courts and other judicial institutions is on its way and finalization instead of this year is expected in Q2 of next year delayed due to Covid 19 pandemic and complexity of the software being developed.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of work with selected companies to develop software for Court sub-system and starting work on software for the Institute for Enforcement of Criminal Sanctions in cooperation with the ICT teams from the Ministry of Justice and Judicial Council.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The work on the development of both software systems is ongoing. The process was slowed down due to Covid pandemic and complexity of the software being developed and the finalisation is delayed to next year. Business Analyses phase of both software is finalised and approved by the ICT working group. The systems are planned to be finalised and in production in the 2nd quarter of 2021,</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
